# hyprconf — Keychron / Lemokey HID access for the web-based launcher.
#
# TAG+="uaccess" is the whole mechanism: systemd's 73-seat-late.rules turns
# the tag into a POSIX ACL on the hidraw node for whoever holds the active
# session, which is what lets launcher.keychron.com reach a board over WebHID
# without running the browser as root.
#
# Why 70- and not 99-, why the match is on vendor alone (and what that costs),
# why there is no MODE=, and which boards are NOT covered: README.md beside
# this file — the one home for all of it. Undo is there too.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="3434", TAG+="uaccess"
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="362d", TAG+="uaccess"
